## Polar Operations Android Production Release Signing Configuration Template
## Copy this file to `keystore.properties` (or set corresponding environment variables).
## NEVER commit your actual keystore or passwords to version control!

# Relative or absolute path to your production Java Keystore (.jks or .keystore)
storeFile=/path/to/my-release-key.jks

# Keystore password
storePassword=MySecureStorePassword123

# Key alias inside the keystore
keyAlias=my-release-alias

# Key password
keyPassword=MySecureKeyPassword123
